{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":9782,"chapterID":76,"chapterNumber":"3","sectionNumber":"28-323.5","title":"§ 28-323.5 Report of condition assessment.","sourceHTMLPath":"code-sections/general-administrative-provisions/chapters/Chapter 3.html","blocks":[{"id":"9782-html-1","kind":"html","html":"</div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-159202\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-159202\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>A report shall be issued by the approved agency following each condition assessment in accordance with sections <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-159205', hash: '#JD_28-323.5.1' }}\">28-323.5.1</Link> and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-159209', hash: '#JD_28-323.5.2' }}\">28-323.5.2</Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-159203\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-159203\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(L.L. 2021/126, 11/7/2021, eff. 1/1/2022) \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-159204\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-159204\"></AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"EdNoteSm\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Editor's note:</span> For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-135195', hash: '#JD_L.L.2021/126' }}\">L.L. 2021/126</Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>","plainText":"A report shall be issued by the approved agency following each condition assessment in accordance with sections 28-323.5.1 and 28-323.5.2 . (L.L. 2021/126, 11/7/2021, eff. 1/1/2022) Editor's note: For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at L.L. 2021/126 ."}]}
